Package: gsm.ctas
Title: Add CTAS Anomaly Detection to gsm
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: c(
    person("Allan", "Hummer", , "allan.hummer.ext@boehringer-ingelheim.com", role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("Björn", "Koneswarakantha", , "bjoern.koneswarakantha@roche.com", role = "aut")
  )
Description: Integrates the 'ctas' clinical trial anomaly detection statistics
    engine into the Good Statistical Monitoring ('gsm') framework. Provides
    mappings from SDTM domains into the long-format input 'ctas' expects,
    data preparation by data type, and aggregation of 'ctas' site scores into
    the gsm analysis contract, together with declarative workflow YAML.
